- Local LLM: Ollama `llama3.1:latest` on `http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1`.
- Build verification: `npm run build` must pass with 0 errors.
- Never upload or fill cover letters.
- Never write `+1` into phone number fields.
- Refer to `CODEBASE_ANALYSIS.md`, `handover.md`, and `AGENTS.md` for detailed context.
